\n                    <div class=\"column\">\n                        <div class=\"triangle t-red\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"month-label\">6月</div>\n                        <div class=\"card\">\n                            <div class=\"card-header bg-red\">中小市值概念股</div>\n                            <div class=\"card-body\">\n                                <span class=\"text-red\">五穷六绝，六月市场波动可能比较大</span>，中小市值公司更容易受到影响，引发概念游资炒作，<span class=\"text-red\">注意金融机构年中结算</span>，市场流动性可能紧张，需要做好严格仓位管理\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Q3 Section -->\n            <section class=\"timeline-section\" style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n                <div class=\"bg-line\"></div>\n                <div class=\"grid-container\">\n                    <!-- July -->\n                    <div class=\"column\">\n                        <div class=\"triangle t-yellow\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"month-label\">7月</div>\n                        <div class=\"card\">\n                            <div class=\"card-header bg-yellow\">七翻身抓新概念</div>\n                            <div class=\"card-body\">\n                                下半年，市场资金也会再次开始活跃，下半年是妖股起飞时节，经过前两个多月休整，<span class=\"text-red\">很多概念题材会迎来新的机会</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- August -->\n                    <div class=\"column\">\n                        <div class=\"triangle t-blue\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"month-label\">8月</div>\n                        <div class=\"card\">\n                            <div class=\"card-header bg-blue\">炒科技板块</div>\n                            <div class=\"card-body\">\n                                各大品牌手机厂商会陆续发布新品，如苹果、华为将引发市场科技热潮，<span class=\"text-red\">此时是掘金科技股产业链的好时机</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- September -->\n                    <div class=\"column\">\n                        <div class=\"triangle t-green\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"month-label\">9月</div>\n                        <div class=\"card\">\n                            <div class=\"card-header bg-green\">军工相关</div>\n                            <div class=\"card-body\">\n                                建军节、国庆节，按照惯例9月份军工相关大幅跑赢其他板块\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </div>\n        <footer>\n            <span>个股仅做展示，不做推荐</span>\n            <span>投资有风险，入市需谨慎</span>\n            <span>仅为理论知识，不构成投资建议</span>\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
